    "description": "PUT/DELETE only. No GET KV, CAS, sessions, deduplication, automatic retry or exactly-once. Loopback HTTP/1.1; configured membership only; body <=49152 bytes; no compression. Strict lexical JSON and runtime extensions apply beyond JSON Schema annotations. Timeout begins at handler admission and includes parsing. A proven exclusion before recording is UNAVAILABLE/not_admitted; deadline after possible recording is TIMEOUT/unknown. No redirects or forwarding."
